// 01 00 # conn handle
// 01 # config id
// 3a 00 # start ACL conn event
// 00 00 # procedure counter
// 00 c0 # frequency compensation
// f7 # reference power level
// 01 # procedure done status
// 01 # subevent done status
// 00 # abort reason
// 01 # num antenna paths
// 19 # num steps reported
// ...

